    "sub_name": "畢業設計(一)",
    "sub_ename": "GRADUATION DESIGN (1)",
    "describe_ch": "課程主要目的有四項：（1）使學生親身體驗學用之歷程，進而了解其本質。（2）提升學生之專業能力。（3）激發學生之創造力。（4）增進學生之表達能力。",
    "describe_eh": "The aims of this course include four items: (1) Enable students to understand the nature of learning to use. (2) Enhance students' professional competence. (3) Stimulate students' creativity. (4) Improve students' ability to express.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
